WEBVTT

00:01:30.420 --> 00:01:31.980
I'm at my limit.

00:01:31.980 --> 00:01:35.190
No one has any strength left.

00:01:35.190 --> 00:01:36.270
Yeah.

00:01:36.270 --> 00:01:38.100
Let's finish this.

00:01:38.480 --> 00:01:40.730
Be my guest.

00:02:13.320 --> 00:02:14.720
Here we go, Daichi!

00:02:14.720 --> 00:02:16.480
Go, Shoot!

00:02:20.740 --> 00:02:22.820
Go, Dragoon!

00:02:23.070 --> 00:02:25.460
Don't you lose,
Gaia Dragoon!

00:02:25.460 --> 00:02:26.930
Dodge it!

00:02:26.930 --> 00:02:29.120
That's it! Go!

00:02:29.430 --> 00:02:31.120
Wow! Amazing!

00:02:31.120 --> 00:02:35.670
Their power and speed is
30% higher than usual today!

00:02:35.840 --> 00:02:41.080
They must be pumped to be
practicing this late at night.

00:02:41.080 --> 00:02:45.440
Damn right! We absolutely have
to win tomorrow's match!

00:02:46.510 --> 00:02:47.880
He's way too pumped!

00:02:48.560 --> 00:02:50.270
I can't blame him.

00:02:50.270 --> 00:02:55.280
With Neo-Borg in the lead, four teams
are fighting for a spot in the finals.

00:02:55.280 --> 00:03:00.090
We need to win our match
against F-Sangre tomorrow.

00:03:00.090 --> 00:03:03.280
Our ticket to the
finals is riding on it!

00:03:03.280 --> 00:03:06.500
That's right! I have to
respond to their passion.

00:03:06.500 --> 00:03:08.830
So I can't let myself lose!

00:03:09.150 --> 00:03:16.660
I'll make it to the finals and accept their
challenge on equal terms, like a champion should!

00:03:20.220 --> 00:03:23.500
What's wrong with you?
Zonin' out in the middle of a battle!

00:03:23.500 --> 00:03:27.010
Keep looking down on me
and you're gonna get burned!

00:03:28.190 --> 00:03:30.840
Daichi's improved
quite a bit as well.

00:03:30.840 --> 00:03:35.840
I wasn't looking down on you.
In fact, I'll be counting on you, Daichi.

00:03:37.490 --> 00:03:40.360
I think you can
handle it now, Daichi.

00:03:40.360 --> 00:03:43.080
Time to practice
our team attack!

00:03:43.080 --> 00:03:44.320
Yeah!

00:03:59.980 --> 00:04:00.980
That's the...

00:04:00.980 --> 00:04:03.530
The combo technique
F-Sangre uses!

00:04:03.530 --> 00:04:07.810
Amazing! Truly amazing, you guys!
When did you master this?

00:04:09.560 --> 00:04:11.060
Piece of cake!

00:04:11.060 --> 00:04:15.740
With this, we'll never lose to
F-Sangre in a four-man battle!

00:04:15.740 --> 00:04:21.380
Call me crazy, but you
sound 30% cooler today!

00:04:21.380 --> 00:04:25.180
But why are you practicing for a
four-man battle now, of all times?

00:04:25.180 --> 00:04:27.580
Why? Ya moron!

00:04:27.580 --> 00:04:31.800
I'm the champion! I can't turn
my back on whoever I fight!

00:04:31.800 --> 00:04:34.210
You don't get something so obvious?

00:04:36.480 --> 00:04:39.690
Amateurs, I swear...

00:04:40.170 --> 00:04:44.790
Didn't you guys feel anything
after seeing Rei's battle?

00:04:44.790 --> 00:04:47.450
It was an incredible match.

00:04:47.450 --> 00:04:51.360
Seeing the four of them
go at it was breathtaking.

00:04:51.360 --> 00:04:53.960
And they all looked like
they were having fun.

00:04:53.960 --> 00:04:59.120
Our coach also praised their battle for
being what's at the heart of Beyblading.

00:04:59.120 --> 00:05:07.280
Right? Though the four-man battle only
happened because Max made that choice.

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:13.880
Speaking of which, why did Max do that?
Knowing how well-coordinated Baihuzu usually is.

00:05:13.880 --> 00:05:18.850
That's it! That's when I realized
what makes an ideal champion!

00:05:18.850 --> 00:05:20.930
So, basically...?

00:05:20.930 --> 00:05:25.570
Taking on someone in their
comfort zone and beating them?

00:05:26.230 --> 00:05:29.500
And that's cool, right?
It totally is!

00:05:29.500 --> 00:05:31.410
That's how I decided!

00:05:31.410 --> 00:05:36.050
In our battle against F-Sangre, I'm going to fight them in their comfort zone,

00:05:36.050 --> 00:05:40.530
and win, fair and square,
like a champion should!

00:05:40.530 --> 00:05:42.980
In the end,
Max lost, though...

00:05:42.980 --> 00:05:45.550
Come on, I'll be fine!

00:05:45.550 --> 00:05:49.480
Drawing out his partner's abilities is
another one of a champion's jobs.

00:05:49.480 --> 00:05:53.410
I'll lead Daichi and
win for sure!

00:05:54.100 --> 00:05:59.200
Drawing out Daichi's abilities? So you've
been practicing with that in mind?

00:05:59.200 --> 00:06:00.720
Of course!

00:06:01.840 --> 00:06:05.040
Expect nothing less from the great
world champion, Takao Kinomiya!

00:06:05.040 --> 00:06:07.890
I'm pretty grown-up
now, don't you think?

00:06:07.890 --> 00:06:10.400
Not like I care, but Takao!

00:06:11.510 --> 00:06:12.790
Hurry up.

00:06:13.360 --> 00:06:18.080
Sorry about that. Would you like
to go one more round, Daichi?

00:06:18.080 --> 00:06:19.630
Eww!

00:06:19.630 --> 00:06:21.100
I'm not so sure...

00:06:21.100 --> 00:06:25.100
Well, it's good that
he's motivated.

00:06:30.010 --> 00:06:32.210
Take a look at this.

00:06:32.500 --> 00:06:36.930
Their shot strength and
RPMs are almost equal.

00:06:36.930 --> 00:06:43.200
If Takao can match his power to Daichi's like this,
I think they'll do well in a four-man battle!

00:06:43.200 --> 00:06:45.290
Wow, it's true!

00:06:45.290 --> 00:06:48.630
Takao's finally starting to
work with Daichi as a team.

00:06:48.630 --> 00:06:50.160
I'm not so sure.

00:06:51.180 --> 00:06:52.670
Coach.

00:06:52.670 --> 00:06:55.840
Kyoujyu, that data
is accurate, right?

00:06:55.840 --> 00:06:57.860
Yes. Is something wrong?

00:06:57.860 --> 00:06:59.100
I wonder if...

00:06:59.780 --> 00:07:03.520
Takao's aware of
what he's doing.

00:07:04.500 --> 00:07:06.680
What's he worried about?

00:07:06.680 --> 00:07:09.890
It's obvious that
Takao's in tip-top shape.

00:07:09.890 --> 00:07:11.010
Yeah.

00:07:11.010 --> 00:07:13.300
Come on!
One more round, Daichi!

00:07:13.300 --> 00:07:14.520
Yeah!

00:07:30.470 --> 00:07:35.840
Julia said she might as well
enjoy herself while she's in Egypt...

00:07:35.840 --> 00:07:39.000
Old habits are
hard to break.

00:07:41.280 --> 00:07:45.060
Are you with those two, sir?

00:07:45.060 --> 00:07:47.390
We can't have
them do this here.

00:07:48.350 --> 00:07:50.190
Who cares?

00:07:50.190 --> 00:07:52.770
Your customers seem to
be enjoying themselves.

00:07:52.770 --> 00:07:55.630
Those kids' performances
are second to none.

00:07:56.420 --> 00:08:01.010
Those kids have been
performing for their whole lives.

00:08:01.440 --> 00:08:07.300
That's right. Raul and I were raised
by a small-time traveling circus.

00:08:16.340 --> 00:08:17.810
Oh no!

00:08:17.810 --> 00:08:20.520
Get it together, butterfingers!

00:08:20.520 --> 00:08:22.330
One more!

00:08:22.330 --> 00:08:27.610
If we can't even pull this off, we can't
be performers like everyone else!

00:08:28.490 --> 00:08:29.810
Yeah...

00:08:30.020 --> 00:08:34.640
We were always traveling,
so we couldn't make friends.

00:08:34.890 --> 00:08:38.050
We just wanted to be
accepted by the troupe,

00:08:38.050 --> 00:08:42.250
so we practiced our
performances, day in and day out.

00:08:43.850 --> 00:08:45.210
Raul!

00:08:45.210 --> 00:08:48.050
Round objects are
so hard to handle!

00:08:48.050 --> 00:08:50.020
I can't balance them...

00:08:50.020 --> 00:08:52.170
Why don't you try this, then?

00:09:00.140 --> 00:09:01.230
What's this?

00:09:01.230 --> 00:09:02.150
A top!

00:09:02.150 --> 00:09:04.350
It's called a Beyblade.

00:09:04.350 --> 00:09:07.950
I figured we could use it for
something, so I bought it in town.

00:09:07.950 --> 00:09:10.810
These are popular
all over the world.

00:09:12.320 --> 00:09:15.740
With a central axis to focus
on and a balanced rotation,

00:09:15.740 --> 00:09:20.610
after using Beyblades, our skills
started to improve little by little.

00:09:26.540 --> 00:09:29.280
Beyblades gave
us confidence.

00:09:29.280 --> 00:09:32.900
And we found our
place among the troupe.

00:09:35.140 --> 00:09:39.390
It's all because of being
introduced to Beyblade.

00:09:46.380 --> 00:09:47.870
Impressive.

00:09:48.600 --> 00:09:51.110
Those kids have really changed.

00:09:53.330 --> 00:09:54.610
Thank you!

00:09:56.130 --> 00:09:57.790
Thank you! Thank you!

00:09:57.790 --> 00:10:01.760
Julia's personality is the one
thing that never changes, though.

00:10:10.630 --> 00:10:12.560
Goodnight!

00:10:18.560 --> 00:10:20.770
You two are in good form.

00:10:20.770 --> 00:10:22.070
Of course we are!

00:10:23.170 --> 00:10:26.100
Can we win tomorrow, sis?

00:10:26.100 --> 00:10:30.010
We'll be fine. Our Beyblades
have never betrayed us.

00:10:30.010 --> 00:10:35.810
That's why we'll fight tomorrow's
battle with our love for these Beyblades.

00:10:36.900 --> 00:10:42.720
The same cheers from that day
are waiting for us. I just know it.

00:11:01.710 --> 00:11:06.240
The exciting battles of the
Egyptian stage meets its final day!

00:11:06.240 --> 00:11:10.450
Will the BBA Revolution win
and get their ticket to the finals?

00:11:10.450 --> 00:11:14.570
Or will F-Sangre keep their hopes
of making it to the finals alive?

00:11:14.570 --> 00:11:17.680
It's time for their
battle to begin!

00:11:18.640 --> 00:11:22.000
The first battle will be...

00:11:23.450 --> 00:11:24.800
A four-man battle!

00:11:27.040 --> 00:11:30.410
I ask that this be a four-man
battle between all of us!

00:11:30.670 --> 00:11:31.900
Takao!

00:11:32.130 --> 00:11:33.500
Sis...!

00:11:34.280 --> 00:11:36.620
He's more simple-minded
than I thought.

00:11:58.690 --> 00:12:03.680
Wow! Even after F-Sangre beat
Baihuzu in a four-man battle,

00:12:03.680 --> 00:12:07.980
Kinomiya has requested
one on his own!

00:12:07.980 --> 00:12:12.800
Is this the pride of the
current champion speaking?

00:12:12.800 --> 00:12:16.290
Of course, F-Sangre
has no complaints!

00:12:16.580 --> 00:12:21.250
This will be the stage
for their four-man clash!

00:12:21.250 --> 00:12:22.500
What's this?

00:12:23.760 --> 00:12:28.140
Just as you see, the final battle
of the Egyptian stage will be in...

00:12:28.140 --> 00:12:29.860
The Sahara Stadium!

00:12:29.860 --> 00:12:35.170
This field of sand will be hard for a Beyblade to navigate! What kind of battle will these four show us?

00:12:35.170 --> 00:12:36.410
Sand...

00:12:36.640 --> 00:12:40.210
F-Sangre has the upper-hand
in four-man battles, but...

00:12:40.210 --> 00:12:44.210
Takao's team has this the advantage in
this stadium since they have more power.

00:12:45.040 --> 00:12:47.540
We're going to win,
no matter what!

00:12:47.540 --> 00:12:49.360
Will you, now?

00:12:49.360 --> 00:12:52.180
Don't underestimate
our Gyro Engines.

00:12:52.180 --> 00:12:53.930
Daichi. Keep up!

00:12:53.930 --> 00:12:55.600
You don't have to tell me!

00:12:55.600 --> 00:12:59.010
Watch me!
Rei, Max, and Kai!

00:12:59.010 --> 00:13:02.450
This is my response
to yesterday's battle!

00:13:02.450 --> 00:13:05.620
Three! Two! One! Go...

00:13:05.620 --> 00:13:06.820
--Shoot!

00:13:14.390 --> 00:13:17.110
The timing on their
shot was on the mark!

00:13:17.110 --> 00:13:19.380
Their training paid off!

00:13:19.380 --> 00:13:21.730
Huh? But look...

00:13:25.860 --> 00:13:27.050
Takao!

00:13:27.840 --> 00:13:30.890
What?
It's nothing, I'm fine.

00:13:30.890 --> 00:13:32.820
Go, Dragoon!

00:13:34.370 --> 00:13:35.380
What?!

00:13:35.380 --> 00:13:36.900
What is this?

00:13:40.580 --> 00:13:43.530
Takao's power is
lower than Daichi's!

00:13:43.530 --> 00:13:44.870
But why?!

00:13:44.870 --> 00:13:46.560
Let's do it, Raul.

00:13:46.560 --> 00:13:47.620
Yeah.

00:13:48.170 --> 00:13:51.090
Go, Flame Pegasus!

00:13:51.090 --> 00:13:53.020
Thunder Pegasus!

00:14:03.250 --> 00:14:04.310
Daichi!

00:14:07.140 --> 00:14:08.630
Me again?!

00:14:08.630 --> 00:14:10.830
Crap! I gotta help Daichi!

00:14:10.830 --> 00:14:13.910
Dang it!
Hang on, Daichi!

00:14:15.410 --> 00:14:18.760
What's the matter?
Hurry up, Dragoon!

00:14:18.760 --> 00:14:19.680
What?!

00:14:19.680 --> 00:14:22.520
What's wrong, Takao?
What're you doing?!

00:14:26.720 --> 00:14:29.060
I wonder what's
going on here?

00:14:29.060 --> 00:14:30.090
I knew it.

00:14:31.180 --> 00:14:34.100
Takao's under
unnecessary pressure.

00:14:34.100 --> 00:14:39.490
He put too much power into his shot, and
that mistake is throwing off his rhythm.

00:14:39.490 --> 00:14:42.510
But last night he wasn't...

00:14:42.510 --> 00:14:45.210
No, I saw the signs of it.

00:14:45.210 --> 00:14:51.490
His decreased power from the pressure
just happened to match Daichi's last night.

00:14:51.490 --> 00:14:53.650
No way...

00:14:53.650 --> 00:14:56.420
But why now, so suddenly?

00:14:57.780 --> 00:14:59.210
Take a look.

00:14:59.410 --> 00:15:03.940
Takao! I thought you were
going to fight me in the finals!

00:15:03.940 --> 00:15:05.310
Don't lose to them!

00:15:05.310 --> 00:15:07.870
Never give up, Takao!

00:15:07.870 --> 00:15:11.210
Rei! Max! Darn it!

00:15:12.080 --> 00:15:15.880
Takao's been completely
spellbound by yesterday's match.

00:15:15.880 --> 00:15:17.490
And then he thought

00:15:17.490 --> 00:15:20.710
he'd fight an even more
intense battle than theirs.

00:15:20.710 --> 00:15:23.920
But that's a good thing, isn't it?

00:15:24.100 --> 00:15:27.860
Takao has always turned those
kinds of feelings into his strength!

00:15:27.860 --> 00:15:31.120
He's beaten plenty of
powerful foes before!

00:15:31.120 --> 00:15:34.350
As long as he just
rushes ahead, that's fine.

00:15:34.350 --> 00:15:39.830
But right now, Takao is too aware
of the fact that he's the champion.

00:15:41.430 --> 00:15:45.220
I'm the champion! I can't turn
my back on whoever I fight!

00:15:45.220 --> 00:15:48.500
That's when I realized what
makes an ideal champion!

00:15:48.500 --> 00:15:52.610
And win, fair and square,
like a champion should!

00:15:52.610 --> 00:15:54.000
That's not all.

00:15:57.540 --> 00:16:00.110
This is more like a
three-man battle to me!

00:16:00.850 --> 00:16:01.920
Dragoon!

00:16:01.920 --> 00:16:04.790
He's rushing to save his partner.

00:16:04.790 --> 00:16:07.830
And the strong feelings
of being the champion.

00:16:08.240 --> 00:16:11.940
Both of those are dragging
Takao and Dragoon down.

00:16:11.940 --> 00:16:15.010
I'm done running away!

00:16:18.170 --> 00:16:19.240
Bring it on!

00:16:19.240 --> 00:16:20.530
Daichi, stop!

00:16:20.530 --> 00:16:22.320
Shut up and watch this!

00:16:26.190 --> 00:16:27.410
--It's gone!

00:16:27.410 --> 00:16:29.090
Where's Gaia Dragoon?

00:16:29.090 --> 00:16:31.000
Right here!

00:16:40.540 --> 00:16:42.040
Raul, are you okay?

00:16:42.040 --> 00:16:43.300
Yeah.

00:16:44.670 --> 00:16:46.510
Where do you
think you're going?!

00:16:49.220 --> 00:16:51.290
Raul! Don't stop!

00:16:51.740 --> 00:16:56.820
Burst Cutter!!

00:17:03.940 --> 00:17:05.220
Raul!

00:17:07.260 --> 00:17:09.970
Leave Raul alone!

00:17:12.050 --> 00:17:13.760
Get back here!

00:17:16.420 --> 00:17:19.440
Don't think you can
beat me here in the sand!

00:17:19.440 --> 00:17:23.870
Stop! The friction from the sand is
going to make you stop spinning!

00:17:23.870 --> 00:17:26.320
Save your advice for
when you catch up!

00:17:26.320 --> 00:17:28.420
I know that!

00:17:28.420 --> 00:17:31.730
The enemy Takao faces today
aren't the Bladers in front of him.

00:17:31.730 --> 00:17:33.820
But within
Takao's own heart.

00:17:34.380 --> 00:17:37.140
There's nothing harder to deal
with than the enemy inside of you.

00:17:37.140 --> 00:17:40.280
The more you panic,
the worse it gets.

00:17:40.280 --> 00:17:44.740
Takao! This isn't like you!

00:17:44.740 --> 00:17:47.840
Rei and Max are watching,
so get it together!

00:17:47.840 --> 00:17:50.960
That's not going to
help if you say that...!

00:17:51.540 --> 00:17:54.660
I can't lose.
I'm the champion!

00:17:54.660 --> 00:17:58.690
I can't look so pathetic
while they're watching me!

00:17:59.650 --> 00:18:03.800
Go! Engine Gear, full power!

00:18:06.540 --> 00:18:09.010
Make way!

00:18:09.460 --> 00:18:10.610
Takao!

00:18:10.610 --> 00:18:14.680
No! If you use your
remaining power here...

00:18:16.390 --> 00:18:17.460
--What?!

00:18:17.460 --> 00:18:18.990
Took ya long enough, Takao!

00:18:18.990 --> 00:18:20.300
Let's do it, Daichi!

00:18:20.300 --> 00:18:23.120
Yeah! Gaia Dragoon!

00:18:23.120 --> 00:18:26.120
Go, Dragoon Galaxy!

00:18:30.500 --> 00:18:32.710
Take this! This is...

00:18:32.710 --> 00:18:35.220
The mark of the champion's
fiery friendship!

00:18:35.220 --> 00:18:38.830
--Twin Tornado Attack!
--Twin Tornado Attack!

00:18:45.170 --> 00:18:46.260
Sis!

00:18:49.860 --> 00:18:50.800
Takao!

00:18:50.800 --> 00:18:52.340
No way!

00:18:54.610 --> 00:18:56.740
They're completely open, Raul.

00:18:59.550 --> 00:19:01.660
Get a load of this!

00:19:01.660 --> 00:19:03.620
This is a real
team attack!

00:19:03.620 --> 00:19:06.220
Gemini Crash!

00:19:39.200 --> 00:19:42.980
The winner is F-Sangre!

00:19:44.260 --> 00:19:46.730
No! Takao...

00:19:47.130 --> 00:19:50.980
He lost...
To someone other than us...

00:19:50.980 --> 00:19:52.670
Pathetic.

00:19:52.670 --> 00:19:57.110
F-Sangre comes back from the brink
of death with their second win!

00:19:57.110 --> 00:20:04.340
Just ahead of the final stage, four teams
are now at two wins and two losses!

00:20:04.340 --> 00:20:07.070
No... How...

00:20:07.070 --> 00:20:09.160
This is isn't what was
supposed to happen!

00:20:09.160 --> 00:20:10.620
Right, Takao?

00:20:10.620 --> 00:20:12.890
I lost...

00:20:12.890 --> 00:20:15.990
But I'm the champion...
So why?

00:20:15.990 --> 00:20:17.300
How?

00:20:17.550 --> 00:20:18.860
Takao?

00:20:18.860 --> 00:20:23.040
Who makes it to the finals
has been left to the final stage!

00:20:23.040 --> 00:20:30.420
Who of the remaining five teams
will make it all the way to the finals?!

00:20:30.420 --> 00:20:33.360
How could this happen?

00:20:33.360 --> 00:20:38.580
With Takao how he is, our
opponents in the final stage is the PPB!

00:20:38.580 --> 00:20:39.860
Coach!

00:20:39.860 --> 00:20:43.380
For now, there's
nothing we can do.

00:20:43.380 --> 00:20:47.860
This is something Takao has
to get through on his own.

00:20:47.860 --> 00:20:50.140
It's the ultimate trial.

00:20:50.850 --> 00:20:53.410
Don't lose, Takao...

00:20:58.060 --> 00:21:01.330
Hey!
They're all looking at us!

00:21:01.330 --> 00:21:06.050
Of course! We beat the
champion fair and square!

00:21:06.050 --> 00:21:09.810
At this rate, becoming champions
ourselves isn't just a dream.

00:21:09.810 --> 00:21:11.130
Champions?!

00:21:11.130 --> 00:21:16.000
And if we do, they'll
cheer for us even louder.

00:21:17.250 --> 00:21:19.750
Just one more!

00:21:19.750 --> 00:21:22.540
Let's ride this wave all
the way to the top, Raul!

00:21:22.540 --> 00:21:23.630
Yeah!

00:22:55.850 --> 00:22:58.370
What the heck
happened to me?

00:22:58.370 --> 00:23:00.670
I feel fine, but I can't
use my strength!

00:23:00.670 --> 00:23:03.380
The more I panic, the
more my body freezes up.

00:23:03.380 --> 00:23:05.430
Kai, Rei, Max...

00:23:05.430 --> 00:23:09.100
I just want to be the ideal
champion they expect me to be!

00:23:09.100 --> 00:23:11.840
Darn it! What the
heck is going on?!

00:23:11.840 --> 00:23:14.180
Why're you trying
to act all cool?

00:23:14.180 --> 00:23:15.890
Right now you're lame!

00:23:15.890 --> 00:23:17.520
You're super lame!

00:23:17.520 --> 00:23:20.900
I'm gonna beat your
passion right out of you!
